"1444592258996244502\",\n  \"accountId\": \"default\",\n  \"limit\": 100\n}\n```\n\nIf that fails, perhaps I should try using `target`? The tool spec says `target` is \"Target channel/user id or name.\" So I could use `target: \"1471005448948813874\"` without separate channel/guild. But that's similar.\n\nMaybe I misread: The `channel` parameter might be for DM/group chats, and for guild channels I need to use `target`? I'll try `target` with channel ID and also `guildId`.\n\nLet's try simpler: `target` with \"1471005448948813874\" and `guildId`.\n\nI'll attempt that.\n</think>\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e9e4f8179e2c4649a772756f","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"search","target":"1471005448948813874","guildId":"1444592258996244502","limit":100}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"stepfun-ai/step-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":100458,"output":1167,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101625,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770788439477}}
