cted in logs)\n- Current configuration: `channels.discord.accounts.default` with token and `groupPolicy: \"allowlist\"`\n- No guild/channel allowlist configured yet, so bot won't respond until channels are added\n\n## Later Updates (05:30–05:50 UTC)\n\n- Identity confirmed: **Ciel** (🌸)\n- Human name confirmed: **Sullen** (not Omar)\n- Config changes:\n  - `channels.discord.guilds[1444592258996244502].requireMention = false` → bot now listens to all messages\n  - `channels.discord.actions.moderation = true` → enabled message deletion capability\n  - Gateway restarted twice to apply patches\n- Channel cleanup attempt:\n  - Ran script to delete all messages in #agent-ciel (channel 1471005448948813874)\n  - Initial script reported 118 messages deleted but actually failed due to poor error handling / rate limits\n  - Channel still has ~188 messages\n  - Plan to implement robust deletion with rate limit handling\n\n## Learnings\n\n- Discord API requires `manage_messages` permission for deletions\n- Need to handle 429 responses with Retry-Await backoff\n- Bulk-delete only works for messages <14 days old; older require individual deletes\n- Always verify actual deletion success, not just HTTP 204, by recounting"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"stepfun-ai/step-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":111254,"output":713,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111967,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770788953398}}
