{"type":"message","id":"2044f8e4","parentId":"8cfab9d7","timestamp":"2026-02-11T06:08:16.670Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":" user is asking me to audit files that load into context each message. According to AGENTS.md, these are:\n\n- AGENTS.md (though they say \"AGENTS.md\" - I see \"AGENTS.md\" in the workspace)\n- TOOLS.md\n- USER.md\n- MEMORY.md (but only load in main session, not in group chats)\n- HEARTBEAT.md\n- SOUL.md\n\nThe user is asking for an audit: for each file, I need to:\n1. What's in here that should be a skill instead of always-loaded context?\n2. What's outdated or redundant?\n3. What's too verbose and could say the same thing in fewer words?\n4. Current size, projected size after cleanup, and estimated token savings.\n\nI need to examine each file. Let me read them one by one and analyze.\n</think>\nI'll audit each of the core context files. Let me read them first and then provide a detailed analysis."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f8471c322e874bb2b7e62d35","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4195e43d1ef84c20b34da5ee","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_488583fd7d5a4be4b361695c","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_13c6b89aef864b3bbea06db7","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4eda91cfef9b488aaa300062","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d9070e3d049b4b0cac8fefef","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"stepfun-ai/step-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":125119,"output":400,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":125519,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopRea